---
/**
 * Shown on every page while the registry is still the bundled example file.
 *
 * Deliberately at the top of the content, not tucked into the sidebar: someone
 * new will otherwise configure tokens and read charts for a while before
 * realising none of the sites are theirs.
 */
---

<div class="demo-banner">
  <div class="demo-banner-text">
    <strong>This is example data</strong>
    The sites listed come from <code>sites.example.json</code>, not from your
    accounts. Nothing here is yours yet.
  </div>
  <a class="button is-primary" href="/sites/new">Add your first site</a>
</div>
